2026-09-11T04:48:50.414240+00:00 critic on 9cb7b5a8c5d29b0e: keep=False issues=["Place='mesopotamian' does not match either actor's tradition: confucius (Confucianism/Chinese tradition) or deucalion (Greek mythology) — model-prior judgment.", "Confucius's traditionally accepted lifespan (c. 551–479 BCE) falls entirely outside the stated interval [-1200,-700] (model-prior, not from supplied evidence).", "Refuting evidence found for this claim id notes that Mesopotamian Utnapishtim's immortality-granted theme 'may not be directly comparable' to Deucalion's founding-patriarch role, undercutting the cross-tradition parallel implied by the mesopotamian place tag."]
